  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 1735c545341a7c841b2ac7f47768a64b, type: 3}
  m_Name: Act_03_PhaseDialogue
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueAsset
  dialogueId: 
  lines:
  - speaker: Narrator
    text: Blow met blow, and neither yielded.
  - speaker: Narrator
    text: The duel stretched on, long and merciless, beyond the count of hours.
  - speaker: Narrator
    text: 'So long they fought that the heavens grew weary:'
  - speaker: Narrator
    text: the sun sank, the red moon climbed, and the mirrored sky changed its master.
  - speaker: Narrator
    text: Beneath the blood-red moon the reflection rose once more...
  - speaker: Narrator
    text: "...stronger than before \u2014 and the battle resumed."
